WEBVTT

00:46:24.636 --> 00:46:30.756
And this was done by Putin
and his airplanes

00:46:30.796 --> 00:46:32.516
and his minions in Syria.

00:46:33.156 --> 00:46:35.516
It's the same person behind it.

00:46:35.516 --> 00:46:38.596
And to think that, "No, no, no,
this happened in the Middle East.

00:46:38.636 --> 00:46:40.156
It can't happen in Europe."

00:46:40.156 --> 00:46:41.396
No.

00:46:41.436 --> 00:46:45.716
We could see Kyiv
in the same situation as Homs,

00:46:45.716 --> 00:46:47.756
as the same situation as Aleppo,

00:46:47.796 --> 00:46:50.156
which would be catastrophic,

00:46:50.196 --> 00:46:53.716
and, again, would plant
terrible seeds of hatred

00:46:53.756 --> 00:46:55.156
for years and decades.

00:46:55.196 --> 00:46:58.556
So far, we've seen
hundreds of people being killed,

00:46:58.596 --> 00:47:01.036
Ukrainian citizens being killed.